{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50028","headline":"句 · 贺兰暹","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉貌自宜双黛翠，桃花独笑一枝春。\n秋水未鸣游女佩，寒云空满望夫山。\n黄阁暮虫罗户牗，紫庭春草遍阶墀。\n绿耳半蔓湘浦竹，骊文乱点武陵花。\n辽阳客路千峰引，蓟北乡心片月知。\n山云渺渺川程远，木叶萧萧鴈过初。\n回鴈不传乡信去，秋风偏向客衣寒。\n千峰黛色因晴出，百谷泉声欲暮寒。\n黛色迥临沧海上，泉声遥落白云中。\n喜遇近臣杨得意，慙非词客马相如。\n秋迎晓月鸿声早，日暎深山水气寒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贺兰暹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50028.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50028","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}